#: class-ml-gallery.php:1604
msgid "Display the current image number and total count"
msgstr "Fi nọ́mbà àwòrán lọwọlọwọ àti apapọ iye hàn"

#: class-ml-gallery.php:1605
msgid "Show a strip of thumbnail images at the bottom of the gallery"
msgstr "Fi àtẹ́ àwòrán àkúnya hàn ní isalẹ àwòrán àgbà"

#: class-ml-gallery.php:1606
msgid "Show dot navigation area below each image."
msgstr "Fi agbegbe ìtòsọ́nà dot hàn ní isalẹ ọkọọkan àwòrán."

#: class-ml-gallery.php:1607
msgid ""
"Pinch or scroll to zoom in and out of gallery images. The Zoom control will "
"appear only if the original size is larger than the gallery size."
msgstr ""
"Fa tabi yí padà láti pọ̀n àti yọkúrò nínú àwòrán àgbà. Iṣakoso Zoom yóò hàn "
"nìkan bí ìwọn àtẹ́yẹ̀ jẹ́ tóbi ju ìwọn àwòrán àgbà lọ."

#: class-ml-gallery.php:1608
msgid "Expand the gallery window to fill the whole screen."
msgstr "Gba àwòrán àgbà láti kó gbogbo iboju."

#: class-ml-gallery.php:1609
msgid ""
"Users can rotate images left or right, plus flip them vertically or "
"horizontally."
msgstr ""
"Àwọn olumulo le yí àwòrán pada si apa osi tàbí ọtun, pẹ̀lú bíbá wọn ṣe "
"pẹ̀lú gígùn tàbí ìtòpọ̀."

#: class-ml-gallery.php:1610
msgid "Automatically advance through the images without the user clicking."
msgstr "Láìsí ìtẹ̀sílẹ̀ láti ọdọ àwọn olumulo, dájú pé a yípadà láàárín àwòrán."

#: class-ml-gallery.php:1611
msgid "Enable users to share images on Facebook, X, or Pinterest."
msgstr "Gba àwọn olumulo láàyè láti pin àwòrán lórí Facebook, X, tàbí Pinterest."

#: class-ml-gallery.php:1612
msgid ""
"Create a unique URL for each image to enable direct linking inside a "
"gallery."
msgstr ""
"Ṣẹda URL tó dára jùlọ fún ọkọọkan àwòrán láti jẹ́ kí ìjápọ̀ taara wọlé nínú "
"àwòrán àgbà."

#: class-ml-gallery.php:1613 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4299
msgid ""
"Discourage casual saving by blocking right-click, drag, and long-press on "
"gallery images."
msgstr ""
"Dákẹ́ ìfipamọ́ àìlera nipa didi tẹ̀ ọtun, fa, àti tẹ́ pẹ̀lú ọwọ́ lórí àwọn "
"àwòrán nínú àkọsílẹ."

#: class-ml-gallery.php:1614
msgid "Navigate images using left and right arrow keys"
msgstr "Ṣàkóso àwọn àwòrán pẹ̀lú bọtìn ìkà kiri ọ̀tún àti òsì"

#: class-ml-gallery.php:1615
msgid "Scroll through images using the mouse wheel"
msgstr "Yíyọ láti inú àwọn àwòrán pẹ̀lú ìkà lélẹ̀"

#: class-ml-gallery.php:1616
msgid "Swipe up or down to close the gallery on touch devices"
msgstr "Yí pada soke tàbí s'ìsà fún ìparí àwòrán àgbà lórí àwọn ẹrọ tó ní ọwọ́"

#: class-ml-gallery.php:1617
msgid "Cycle back to the first image after reaching the last"
msgstr "Lọ́ sẹ́yìn sí àwòrán àkọ́kọ́ lẹ́yìn tí o bá dé àwòrán tó kẹhin"

#: class-ml-gallery.php:1618
msgid "Show a download button for each image"
msgstr "Fi bọtìn ìdáwọ́le hàn fún ọkọọkan àwòrán"

#: class-ml-gallery.php:1619
msgid ""
"Open images in a window overlay when clicked. Applies to Grid, Masonry, and "
"Justified layouts."
msgstr ""
"Ṣí àwòrán nínú àwòrán ikọ̀kọ́ nígbà tí a bá tẹ. Ó wúlò fún Grid, Masonry, "
"àti Justified layouts."

#: class-ml-gallery.php:1620
msgid "Show a button over the gallery that opens the gallery window when clicked."
msgstr "Fi bọtini han lori ile-iṣẹ ti o ṣii window ile-iṣẹ nigbati o ba tẹ."

#: class-ml-gallery.php:1621
msgid "Show an icon on the button instead of text."
msgstr "Fi aami han lori bọtini dipo ọrọ."

#: class-ml-gallery.php:1664
msgid "Full (original)"
msgstr "Kíkún (ìbáṣepọ̀)"

#: class-ml-gallery.php:1668
msgid "Show in Gallery Window"
msgstr "Fi hàn ní Àwòrán Àgbà"

#: class-ml-gallery.php:1671
msgid "The size of the image shown when a visitor clicks to view it in full"
msgstr "Iwọn àwòrán tó hàn nígbà tí alejo bá tẹ láti wo rẹ ní kíkún"

#: class-ml-gallery.php:1671
msgid "Image Size"
msgstr "Iwọn Àwòrán"

#: class-ml-gallery.php:1691
msgid ""
"Choose how visitors open the gallery window: click the image, click an "
"icon, or click a button."
msgstr ""
"Yan bi awọn alejo ṣe le ṣii ferese àwòrán: tẹ aworan, tẹ aami, tabi tẹ "
"bọtini."

#: class-ml-gallery.php:1691
msgid "Open with"
